== 3. what the ENGINE law would rule on fixture E's single green pair
   fixture E has exactly ONE jointly-green pair and it corrupts Vec3.__add__;
   one green at one site is not ambiguous, so:
   decide(BUILT=1, AMB=0) = SHIP
   decide(BUILT=1, AMB=1) = ADD_STATE   (fixture A and C: two greens at two sites)
